---
manual: edit_line.block_is_change
lines: [3081, 3082]
testability: interactive
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $seen = []
  @line = edit_line { $seen << @line.text }
end
----------- test code
assert_empty $seen, "the block waits for a change"

edit_line.trigger_change("S")
edit_line.trigger_change("Sh")

assert_equal %w[S Sh], $seen, "a block given to edit_line receives its change events"
